JOB SUMMARY:
We are seeking a skilled and motivated Embedded Software Engineer with a strong background in Embedded Linux and C++ to join our dynamic development team. In this role, you will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining software for embedded systems, ensuring seamless integration with Linux-based environments. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to deliver high-performance solutions for a variety of embedded applications.

